{"about_the_game":"Welcome to Kakun City, a city with unusual and mysterious fires! You are a newcomer to the fire brigade, but you have a special mission: to rescue cats in trouble. Your job is not just putting out the fire, but a real feat for the little furry residents of the city!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFireTruck Rescue is a Top-Down View arcade game where you control a fire truck. Your task is to react quickly to alarms, find houses that are on fire and extinguish fires, while rescuing all the cats in danger.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451490?t=1740806819","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451490?t=1740806819","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451490/07417a502a64aad11b0466ebd59389dcbbd7c67e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740806819","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451490/07417a502a64aad11b0466ebd59389dcbbd7c67e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740806819","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Welcome to Kakun City, a city with unusual and mysterious fires! You are a newcomer to the fire brigade, but you have a special mission: to rescue cats in trouble. Your job is not just putting out the fire, but a real feat for the little furry residents of the city!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFireTruck Rescue is a Top-Down View arcade game where you control a fire truck. Your task is to react quickly to alarms, find houses that are on fire and extinguish fires, while rescuing all the cats in danger.","developers":["TolaTolaGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451490/header.jpg?t=1740806819","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highligh